	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『機動戦士ガンダム SEED FREEDOM』でも複数機で活躍！専用パーツの差替えによりMA形態への変形も再現したオーブの量産型可変MSが商品化！",
			"• 戦闘機状態のシルエットを美しく表現するため、変形機構をオミットしパーツ差替えでMA形態のフォルムを再現。",
			"• ビームライフルのフォアグリップは収納・展開が可能。MA形態時にはライフルを主翼に接続することができる。",
			"• 全身の差し色をはじめ、頭部の色分けなどはパーツ分割で細部まで再現。",
			"• 複数機を揃えることで、編隊を組んだ作戦行動を再現することも可能。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Multiple units played major roles in Mobile Suit Gundam SEED FREEDOM!",
			"Mass-produced Mobile Suits used by Orb, and the transformation into MA form can be recreated using dedicated exchangeable parts.",
			"• The transformation mechanism is omitted and the form of the MA form is reproduced with replacement parts, in order to beautifully express the silhouette of the MA form.",
			"• Beam Rifle's foregrip can be retracted and deployed. The rifle can be connected to the main wing in MA form.",
			"• Collect multiple units to recreate formations for tactical operations.",
			"[Includes:]",
			"• Beam Saber × 1",
			"• Beam Rifle × 1",
			"• Shield × 1",
			"• MA transformation parts × 1",
			"• Drop tank parts × 2",
			"• Stickers × 1"
		]
	},
